    title: "Bar Study Skills Crash Course",
    description:
      "A five-week course that equips students with the essential learning skills and strategies needed to prepare effectively for — and pass — the bar exam. For repeat takers, it's the chance to rebuild study habits from the ground up and enter bar prep with greater confidence, clarity, and readiness.",
